The package CalMono

&#x09;Perform calcium imaging and immunofluorescent labeling images in Carl Zeiss Image format.

&#x09;Segment neuronal pixels from calcium imaging image.

&#x09;Match to the pixels from immunofluorescent image.

&#x09;Perform signal processing of the calcium imaging data and quantify neuronal activities.

